G1 X60.0 E9.0 F1000 ; thick intro line
G1 X140.0 E12.5.0 F1000 ; thin intro line

; retract 3 mm and wipe the nozzle
M106 ; Turns on fan to full speed
G92 E0
G1 X200 E-3 F1000 
G92 E0.0 ; reset extruder position

; Raise nozzle and start print
G1 Z10 F5000
